{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":158319,\"title\":\"Ex Aku Pontianak\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"A playboy named Malik who is hunted down by his ex -girlfriend, Bella for having an affair. Malik is shocked to find out Bella is actually a vampire and he enlists the help of Suraya, a vampire hunter who has her own mission to eliminate evil vampires (like Bella) who are trying to gather new powers.\",\"posterPath\":null,\"backdropPath\":null,\"youtubeBackdrop\":\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/heks-bVmSA4/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":1,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":2022,\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Returning Series\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":1,\"totalEpisodes\":10,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"Astro Ria\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"MY\",\"name\":\"Malaysia\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2022-03-23\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1292086,\"name\":\"Shamyl Othman\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2140589,\"name\":\"Ikmal Amry\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7AMMTmFjRiwZoh5B3X1angCiwH1.jpg\"},{\"id\":1517765,\"name\":\"Elizabeth Tan\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ypEaId0eRPNeBZFRwLQkm4M1AgI.jpg\"},{\"id\":1666367,\"name\":\"Raysha Rizrose\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bli2FQ9xXzHeuwH9ACTh7h4X3Wx.jpg\"},{\"id\":2047625,\"name\":\"Fikhree Bakar\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dIAU5W7FhFvPuLiHkYOdVgiL4bR.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"heks-bVmSA4\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"X2pJDhUahYI\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"bpRqvK-W2F0\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":null,\"seasonAirDate\":\"2022-01-19\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Malik Si kasanova\",\"overview\":\"Malik, a gamer and TV host, has grown tired of Bella. Seeing Malik on a date with another woman, Bella sends zombies to disturb Malik. Malik enlists the help of Suraya, the pontianak slayer.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-01-19\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Suraya, si pemburu pontianak\",\"overview\":\"Suraya wants to complete her quest of slaying 20 'pontianaks' to heal her mother's eye. Suraya go on a date with Malik, but they get caught. Suraya realises that Bella is the last 'pontianak' she needs.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-01-26\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Bella, Si Daring\",\"overview\":\"Bella is a beautiful 'pontianak' who often falls victim to playboys. She becomes cautious when it comes to dating. But Malik betrays her as well, so Bella orders Amran and Zafran to attack Malik.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-02-02\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Serangan Zombie 101\",\"overview\":\"Malik and Suraya run from Amran and Zafran. Malik is afraid to go home so he stays over at Suraya's home. Malik suggests that Suraya follows Fifi and Jay, who are visiting the Pontibar.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-02-09\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Jay, Bella, Fifi Dan ...\",\"overview\":\"Jay is sceptical when the the slayer looks for them. Jay and Fifi are shocked to find Bella in their house. Bella tells them that Malik is cheating on her. Fifi feels sorry for Bella but Jay is suspicious.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-02-16\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Misi Kalahkan Zombie\",\"overview\":\"Furious that her plan did not work, Bella bites Joe to turn him into a zombie. Suraya, Malik, Jay and Fifi break into Bella's hideout and are attacked by Zafran and Amran.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-02-23\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Panduan Tewaskan Zombie\",\"overview\":\"Fifi uses her hairstyling expertise to defeat Amran. Amran shows the bite on his neck, proving that Bella is an evil 'pontianak'. Suraya is determined to destroy Bella but Fifi and Jay disagree.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-03-02\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Dimana Azimat Bella?\",\"overview\":\"Suraya wants to find Bella's charm as soon as possible. Fifi and Jay try to persuade Bella to repent but it falls on deaf ears. Suraya and Malik break into Bella's home and find her metal safe.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-03-09\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Pontianak VS pemburu pontianak\",\"overview\":\"Malik invites Bella to meet. Bella uses a zombie Joe to attack. Bella is forced to fight them herself. Malik runs with the metal safe, which they believe to be Bella's charm.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-03-16\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Semuanya terungkai\",\"overview\":\"Saddened by what happened, Bella attacks Suraya. Finally, Malik finds Bella's charm and Bella is destroyed. A year later, Suraya and Jay are invited to Malik's wedding, but are shocked when they see Bella.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-03-23\",\"runtime\":0}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2022-01-19\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}